# YallaCancel — Cursor Rules

## Brand
- Brand name: **يلا كنسل** (NOT يلا كانسل)
- North Star UX reference: justcancel.io
- Design inspo: Surfe.com (palette), Ilham.io (Arabic/Saudi UI)

## Language & Copy
- **Saudi Arabic dialect only** — never formal/MSA
- **No harakat or tanween** — no tashkeel on any Arabic text
- **RTL first** — Arabic is the primary language, English secondary
- **Never use the word "free" (مجاناً)** anywhere on the site
- Always provide copy variations for text changes — let the user choose

## Stack
- **Framework**: Next.js 16, React 19, TypeScript
- **Styling**: Tailwind CSS v4 (use `@theme` variables, NOT v3 config)
- **Animations**: Framer Motion
- **Icons**: Lucide React
- **AI**: Claude API (Anthropic) — subscription detection via /api/parse-pdf
- **PDF Parsing**: LlamaCloud (LlamaParse)
- **Payments**: Whop.com (embedded checkout via @whop/checkout)
- **Hosting**: Vercel (auto-deploy from GitHub main)
- **CDN/DNS**: Cloudflare

## Architecture
- App pages: `src/app/`
- Components: `src/components/`
- Logic/utils: `src/lib/`
- Static HTML cancel guides: `public/cancel-*.html`
- API routes (serverless on Vercel):
  - `/api/parse-pdf` — Claude AI statement analysis (rate limited)
  - `/api/verify-payment` — Whop receipt verification
  - `/api/whop-webhook` — Whop payment webhooks
- Locale persisted in localStorage via `src/lib/locale-store.ts`
- Payment state persisted via `src/lib/payment-store.ts`

## Design system (Surfe-inspired)
- Background: `#EDF5F3` (light mint), not pure white
- Text primary: `#1A3A35` (dark teal-navy)
- Text secondary: `#4A6862`
- Text muted: `#8AADA8`
- Green accent: `#00A651`
- Primary CTA: dark navy `#1A3A35`, white text, rounded-full
- Cards: white, rounded-3xl, soft shadow, border `#E5EFED`
- No gradients on backgrounds. No purple. No indigo.

## Behavior rules
1. **Always push** after changes — never ask "want me to push?"
2. **Build one component at a time.** Never rewrite the whole page unless asked.
3. **Read before editing.** Always read the file before modifying it.
4. **RTL first.** Default language is Arabic. All new UI must work in both RTL and LTR.
5. **Bilingual.** All user-visible strings must have both Arabic and English versions.
6. **Tailwind v4 syntax.** Use `@theme` CSS variables. Do NOT use `tailwind.config.js` v3 patterns.
7. **No unnecessary files.** Don't create new files unless required. Prefer editing existing ones.
8. **No over-engineering.** Don't add features, abstractions, or error handling beyond what's asked.
9. **Framer Motion for animations.** Don't use CSS keyframes when Framer Motion exists.
10. **Lucide for icons.** Don't add new icon libraries.
11. **Security.** Never log PII. Validate at system boundaries. Rate limit API routes.

## Frontend Design Quality
- Typography: Use distinctive, characterful font choices (Noto Sans Arabic for AR, Plus Jakarta Sans for EN)
- Color: Commit to the Surfe palette. Dominant colors with sharp accents
- Motion: Focus on high impact moments — staggered page loads over scattered micro-interactions
- Spatial Composition: Generous negative space, asymmetry where appropriate
- NEVER produce cookie-cutter AI-looking design. Every component should feel intentionally designed for يلا كنسل's brand
